URL:https://www.law.cam.ac.uk/events/law-age-ai-interdisciplinary-dialogue
CATEGORIES:Law
DESCRIPTION:Faculty of Law\nTopics: Law\nDetails: https://www.law.cam.ac.uk
 /events/law-age-ai-interdisciplinary-dialogue\nCambridge University AI in 
 Law Society (CUAILS)\n\n Date/time: \n\n Thursday 19 November 2026 \n\n 7:
 00pm to 8:30pm\n\n Location: \n\n David Williams Building\, Faculty of Law
 \n\n LG18\n\n About \n\n This is the inaugural event of the Cambridge Univ
 ersity AI in Law Society (CUAILS) \, a newly established society recognise
 d by the Faculty of Law!\n As artificial intelligence continues to reshape
  the legal landscape\, what opportunities and challenges lie ahead for leg
 al research\, regulation\, and practice? How might AI transform the legal 
